{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓今（15日）早發生奪命火警，一個低層單位起火及冒出濃煙，消防員到場開喉將火救熄後，在起火單位內發現一具女屍。警方與消防將於下午1時召開記者會交代案情，《香港01》屆時會現場直播。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198611750300291072642817.jpeg/9Q-9zvM7NSKSCT3MkgYnd9ruRcihV6ZGR0Na52JDWuc\"/><figcaption>涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員射水灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198611747833909248894613.jpeg/YcHUF5yol3kKHyKS8sl3CFd6uXrJD2RRgonJIaeJySE\"/><figcaption>消防員射水灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584763535855616985120.jpeg/NebTkxRCG8SBjPdGZmSBEG2R8CFY3p7aRVoY-WBaGPk\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584765964488704647519.jpeg/3bUECLJpg7QrGWcjvLaxEgYeyxPGfYP8ozLBFYYywRU\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584768195989504873526.jpeg/NquZxAQczoqrBpR-P27h6opidOy7iKqW0saFl_fGhZc\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584770419101696125378.jpeg/Ir7u9r6JamnGnhHOwi74bJ-UM-DfQhzeAZVckSSVXJE\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574259484495872427308.jpeg/26t90eNb6egzo0KPV20hHlfAPPWmJ88wEaWObjSljm4\"/><figcaption>涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574262127038464710845.jpeg/s1SoNvbUjOIeMo4ME-Kdkjf3uBsgSSXGjNpYZKnaWGQ\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574264803135488807436.jpeg/gSrjowDzY2XuyyAkWNYwS4LydZJe4d6FlHeigbF3ooE\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574267575701504439675.jpeg/R1Q4Tpsb_S_nI_DzrQxehtrbSJi6tH4WXdQRJnjUESY\"/><figcaption>警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574258402365440251843.jpeg/mVPNMRO_XcSXx3TX77FmzHEmweGJ5JYJpfKaGYDymhk\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574261212680192072451.jpeg/4msVWr-ANKmlhwfuEn5_NmrsWdPfvO_DVoaGgHOGhoA\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565173401489408403751.jpeg/upmPrJgqsL85VRky7Ni8Xng4cppmF1zEV5aVM1eWlTM\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙從單位湧出。（Alex Ox ChamkinGs/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565176006283264762059.png/Da6P1wRvKKld2LhNqM4VAjmWdi1lHZI5OcBi-znAYvs\"/><figcaption>濃煙從單位湧出。（Alex Ox ChamkinGs/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565178506219520350146.jpeg/5e4iWEWj-zmaGGoct0Zt6rANh_cTXB8acZcAu3GXALs\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:15:57.896830+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":488,"images":15,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:49:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:29:42